      "id": "section-6ad3e2ac94fa5e0921aa2dc7",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 9,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Each leaflet has one clear job: get people borrowing, get people lending what’s already in their shed, or show existing lenders why they’d keep more on Lendit. We kept the copy short, used real app screens and photos of real handovers, and added local QR codes so every leaflet feels like it’s from the neighbourhood.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
